EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

Thank you for contacting us regarding the status of your transcript. It generally takes two to three weeks to match a transcript to your application, though it could take longer at times of higher volume. If you requested your transcript be sent to ASU more than a month ago, please check with your registrar to make sure it was delivered. You may need to have it resent.

I appreciate your patience, and I encourage you to check My ASU regularly at https://my.asu.edu. Your Priority Tasks list will be updated once the transcript has been received.

Please let me know if you have any additional questions about the admission process.

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}

If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.

{!Case.Thread_Id}
